  "slug": "room-block-incident-report-form",
  "title": "Room Block Incident Report Form",
  "subtitle": "Record a failure against a contracted block - a walked guest, an oversell, an accessible room not delivered, or a rate dispute - and route the remedy.",
  "description": "An original incident record for guest-room block failures. It captures incident identity and the guests affected, the factual account with the reservation and inventory history, the immediate remedy including relocation detail, qualified review, corrective actions with verification, and a closeout naming residual risk.",
  "use_case": "Use when a group guest is turned away or relocated, the block was oversold, a committed accessible room was not delivered, or a rate or attrition charge is disputed at the desk. The report closes only after the manager on duty reviews it and the remedy is verified with the guest and the group contact.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
  "sections": [
    {
      "key": "incident_identity",
      "title": "Incident identity and guests affected",
      "guidance": "Fix the incident in time, block, and guest.",
