          "key": "record_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Record boundary for this report",
          "guidance": "Record observed facts, times, and actions. Do not record identification numbers, payment card details, health information, or conclusions about liability or staff discipline. Collect only the guest contact detail needed to complete the remedy and handle it under applicable privacy policy."
        }
      ]
    },
